Z||000004||Raydar||11-05-2001||05:43 PM||||True story:<BR>Last week my wife was driving home from work. <BR>A car pulled halfway out of a driveway into her lane. She was quite a way back and had plenty of time to stop, which she did. The man backed up, back into the driveway.<BR>As she was driving past, she looked at him and noticed that he was wearing DARK sunglasses, and had a dog in a harness on the front seat with him.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><BR>I asked her if there was a white cane with a red tip on each of the fenders. Apparently not. <P>Q. "Why don't blind people skydive?"<BR>A. "It scares the sh!t out of the dogs." <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||1
