Z||000018||Mach10||11-06-2001||09:16 PM||||I see a lot of blind people at the movies... It'd be the same as listening to a radio-broadcasted play... Only a whole hell of a lot better with 6-way surround sound...<P>Also, I deal with blind internet users all day... They got some nifty IE plugins that read off entire webpages... Even frames...<BR>Although java buttons are annoying, since they report back as "Button, Java. Button, Java. Button, Java."   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>EDIT<BR>Wait, this sounds a little harsh... It's not meant to be... It's just an FYI  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR><p>[This message has been edited by Mach10 (edited 11-06-2001).]||||reg||12
